OL,0,          BTXT64  GWed 25.11.26 22:04:55
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FPetsciiProxy             
OL,3,   EUltimateD]GLocal installation       
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5,CRequirements:                          
OL,6, - A Windows/Mac/Linux PC, NAS or       
OL,7,   RaspberryPi                          
OL,8, - You need to know the IP-address of   
OL,9,   this PC                              
OL,10, - The PetsciiProxy server              
OL,12,CInstallation                           
OL,13, You can find stand alone executables in
OL,14, theFdistGfolder on GitHub. Download the
OL,15, appropriate file for your system.      
OL,17, Copy the program to a directory of your
OL,18, liking. The program automatically      
OL,19, creates subfolders for each teletext   
OL,20, service to store pages.                
OL,22, - Start a command prompt / terminal    
OL,23,D]F202G<<                >>F300 B]D1/2  
OL,24,AMain page  BA-Z Index  CInstall  FAbout
FL,100,199,200,300,0,100
