OL,0,          BTXT64  GWed 25.11.26 22:04:55
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FPetsciiProxy             
OL,3,   EUltimateD]GLocal installation       
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5, - Start the proxy program. Note that   
OL,6,   your PC may ask you permission for   
OL,7,   accessing the local network.         
OL,9, - You should see something like this:  
OL,10,  BTeletext PetsciiProxy server v2.7.0, 
OL,11,  Bserving on port 8080                 
OL,13, - If you want another port, just start 
OL,14,   the program with a parameter.        
OL,16, - UseC--helpGto see all parameter      
OL,17,   options.                             
OL,23,D]F202G<<                >>F300 B]D2/2  
